---
name: non-functional-requirement
version: 1.0.0
description: Render a non-functional requirement record.
required_variables: [record]
optional_variables: [references]
defaults: {references: ""}
---
# {{ record.id }}: {{ record.title }}

**Status:** {{ record.status }}
**Owner:** {{ record.document_metadata.owner }}
**ID Range:** {{ record.document_metadata.id_range }}

{% set body = record.content.markdown %}
{% set sections = ["Overview", "Requirement Statement", "Rationale", "Success Criteria", "Dependencies", "Product Applicability", "Implementation Notes", "Test Strategy", "Validation Policy (Optional)", "Related Documents"] %}
{% if "## " in body %}{{ body }}

{% endif %}{% for section in sections %}{% if ("## " ~ section) not in body %}## {{ section }}

{% if "## " not in body and section == "Requirement Statement" %}{{ body }}

{% endif %}{% endif %}{% endfor %}
